{
  "uid": "model-performance",
  "title": "Model performance",
  "description": "Input drift, real error and range coverage of the latest tested window of 1,000 requests (FR-14, NFR-11), written by the drift job every 15 minutes, and the live model outputs between its passes. Provisioned from deploy/grafana/dashboards/model-performance.json; change that file, not the UI (docs/docs/monitoring.md#model-performance).",
